      <div class="body-copy reveal mt-7" >
        <p>In Ontario, anyone you hire to do electrical work in your home must be a Licensed Electrical Contractor. Licences are issued through ECRA, the Electrical Contractor Registration Agency of the Electrical Safety Authority (ESA).</p>
        <p>HausPower holds ECRA licence #7018055, and a licensed master electrician leads every project.</p>
